{%- doc -%}
  Variant options - Figma 7930:96080 (swatches) / 7930:96094 (chips) - with
  the size guide link on the Size row (or the last row, or on its own).

  @param {object} block - the "Variant picker" block
  @param {object} product - the product being viewed
  @param {object} current_variant - the variant the page opens on
  @param {boolean} has_size_guide - whether this product gets the size guide
  @param {number} ship_days_in_stock - "Ready to ship · Get by" days
  @param {number} ship_days_made - "Made to order · Get by" days

  ZNow (Figma 8488:70168): the LAST option's heading (or the only option's)
  carries the picked variant's shipping tag - "Now · Get today" (ZNow area)
  or "Ready to ship · Get by 2nd Nov" when it has stock, "Made to order ·
  Get by 13th Nov" when not - and each of its values in stock alongside the
  other picks wears the Z badge (every pincode: it marks ready to ship). product.js keeps both in
  step as options change; Liquid draws the first paint from current_variant.
{%- enddoc -%}

<div class="pdp_block" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- liquid
    comment
      The size guide sits on the Size row. A product with a size chart but no
      Size option (a chain length, say) hangs it on its last option's row
      instead, rather than on an empty row of its own.
    endcomment
    assign has_size_option = false
    for option in product.options_with_values
      if option.name contains 'Size'
        assign has_size_option = true
      endif
    endfor

    assign ship_state = 'none'
    if current_variant.available
      assign ship_state = 'made'
      if current_variant.inventory_quantity > 0
        assign ship_state = 'stock'
      endif
    endif

    comment
      Last-option values with stock alongside the current picks of the other
      options: "|value|" keys, matched below.
    endcomment
    assign znow_stock_keys = ''
    assign other_count = product.options.size | minus: 1
    for stock_variant in product.variants
      if stock_variant.available and stock_variant.inventory_quantity > 0
        assign same_others = true
        for i in (0..other_count)
          if forloop.last
            break
          endif
          if stock_variant.options[i] != current_variant.options[i]
            assign same_others = false
          endif
        endfor
        if same_others
          assign znow_stock_keys = znow_stock_keys | append: '|' | append: stock_variant.options.last | append: '|'
        endif
      endif
    endfor
  -%}
  {%- comment -%} A product without options has only Shopify's "Default Title" - no rows for it. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
  {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
    {%- liquid
      comment
        Picks come from current_variant (sections/product), not
        option.selected_value - it may start on a different variant.
      endcomment
      assign option_index = forloop.index0
      assign is_swatch = false
      if option.name contains 'Color' or option.name contains 'Colour' or option.name contains 'Metal'
        assign is_swatch = true
      endif
      assign show_guide = false
      if has_size_guide
        if option.name contains 'Size'
          assign show_guide = true
        elsif has_size_option == false and forloop.last
          assign show_guide = true
        endif
      endif
      if show_guide
        assign size_guide_inline = true
      endif
    -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A radio group with an ordinary heading rather than fieldset/legend:
      browsers lay a legend out in their own way, which once pushed the size
      guide link onto the size chips. The link sits on the heading line, level
      with the option name ("Size .... Size guide"); the values wrap freely
      below.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div
      class="pdp_option{% if is_swatch %} pdp_option--swatch{% endif %}"
      role="radiogroup"
      aria-labelledby="PdpOption{{ option.position }}"
      data-option-group
      data-option-position="{{ option.position }}"
    >
      <div class="pdp_option_top">
        <p class="pdp_option_head" id="PdpOption{{ option.position }}">
          <span class="pdp_option_head_name">
            {{- option.name -}}
            {%- if is_swatch %}:{% endif -%}
          </span>
          {%- if is_swatch -%}
            <span class="pdp_option_head_value" data-option-readout>{{ current_variant.options[option_index] }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if forloop.last -%}
            <span class="pdp_ship_tag" data-ship-tag data-state="{{ ship_state }}">
              <span class="pdp_ship_tag_pill pdp_ship_tag_pill--znow" data-znow-only>
                <span class="pdp_ship_tag_now">
                  {{- 'icon-znow-8.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                  <span>Now</span>
                </span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                <span data-znow-when="today">Get today</span>
                <span data-znow-when="tomorrow">Get tomorrow</span>
              </span>
              <span class="pdp_ship_tag_pill pdp_ship_tag_pill--ready" data-znow-hide>
                Ready to ship <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Get by
                <span data-ship-date="in-stock">{% render 'ship-date', days: ship_days_in_stock %}</span>
              </span>
              <span class="pdp_ship_tag_pill pdp_ship_tag_pill--made">
                Made to order <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Get by
                <span data-ship-date="made">{% render 'ship-date', days: ship_days_made %}</span>
              </span>
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        {%- if show_guide -%}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="pdp_link pdp_option_guide"
            data-open="size-guide"
            data-analytics="size_guide_open"
            data-analytics-product-category="{{ product.type | escape }}"
            data-analytics-click-location="pdp"
          >
            <span class="pdp_option_guide_icon" aria-hidden="true">
              {{- 'icon-ruler.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
            </span>
            {{ block.settings.size_guide_label | default: 'Size guide' }}
          </button>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

        <div class="pdp_option_values">
          {%- assign option_is_last = forloop.last -%}
          {%- for value in option.values -%}
            {%- assign value_key = value | prepend: '|' | append: '|' -%}
            <label
              class="pdp_option_values_value{% if option_is_last and znow_stock_keys contains value_key %} is-znow-stock{% endif %}"
              {% if option_is_last %}
                data-znow-value
              {% endif %}
            >
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="option-{{ option.position }}"
                value="{{ value | escape }}"
                data-option-input
                {% if value == current_variant.options[option_index] %}
                  checked
                {% endif %}
              >
              {%- if is_swatch -%}
                <span
                  class="pdp_option_values_value_swatch"
                  style="--pdp-swatch: {% if value.swatch.image %}url({{ value.swatch.image | image_url: width: 64 }}){% elsif value.swatch.color %}{{ value.swatch.color }}{% else %}var(--pdp-swatch-{{ value | handle }}, #ddd){% endif %};"
                >
                  <span class="visually-hidden">{{ value }}</span>
                </span>
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="pdp_option_values_value_chip">{{ value }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if option_is_last -%}
                <span class="pdp_option_values_value_znow" aria-hidden="true">
                  {{- 'icon-znow-badge-8.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </label>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
    </div>
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endunless -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Only reached when the product has no options to hang the guide on, so
    the sidesheet still has a way in.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if has_size_guide and size_guide_inline != true -%}
    <div class="pdp_option pdp_option--guide-only">
      <button
        type="button"
        class="pdp_link"
        data-open="size-guide"
        data-analytics="size_guide_open"
        data-analytics-product-category="{{ product.type | escape }}"
        data-analytics-click-location="pdp"
      >
        <span class="pdp_option_guide_icon" aria-hidden="true">
          {{- 'icon-ruler.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </span>
        {{ block.settings.size_guide_label | default: 'Size guide' }}
      </button>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
